/A 1538 0 R
/Alt (Plot tracing the figure of merit as a function of trial number over 200 trials. The figure of merit fluctuates between about 1.2 to 2.0; the baseline 1.68 is noted for reference. Sobol samples are shown on the left and Bayesian optimisation samples are on the right. The baseline is exceeded with the Sobol samples. The best design found by the Bayesian optimisation sequence begins with a sharp increase from the Sobol samples followed by a gradual plateau to 2.038.)
/K [50 1539 0 R]
/P 148 0 R
/Pg 51 0 R
/S /Figure
/T (FIGURE 9)
/Type /StructElem
