/A 1549 0 R
/Alt (Scatter plot matrix showing the distribution of design evaluations in each two-dimensional slice from the four-dimensional search space with parameters: breeder region length, breeder region thickness, multiplier apothem thickness, and outer coolant region thickness. Designs broadly cover the space while exhibiting notable concentration towards the best design found at mid-to-high breeder region thickness, low multiplier apothem thickness, low outer coolant region thickness, and high breeder region length. The concentration for the length parameter is noticeably less defined than for the three radial parameters.)
/K [18 1550 0 R]
/P 159 0 R
/Pg 52 0 R
/S /Figure
/T (FIGURE 10)
/Type /StructElem
>>
